{"id":"663565","name":"土豆蒸排骨","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/663565/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"排骨","amount":"适量"},{"name":"土豆","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"剁椒","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆豉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨清水浸泡出血水，洗净擦干水份备用。","img":"images/663565/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"蒜头拍扁剁碎。","img":"images/663565/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"碗中放入蒜末和豆豉。","img":"images/663565/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量剁椒。","img":"images/663565/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"加入适量蚝油，生抽和老抽，鸡精。","img":"images/663565/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"淋上热油，搅拌均匀。","img":"images/663565/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"排骨加入适量玉米淀粉。","img":"images/663565/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"加入调好的酱汁。","img":"images/663565/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"抓拌均匀腌制半小时左右入味。","img":"images/663565/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"土豆洗净去皮切滚刀块。","img":"images/663565/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将土豆放入排骨中一起拌匀。","img":"images/663565/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀后将土豆和排骨码入碗中，上锅蒸30分钟左右。","img":"images/663565/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663565/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663565/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/663565/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：高压锅、蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}